                <invention-title lang="de">VERWALTUNG EINES ACHSENGETRIEBENEN GENERATORS IN EINEM TRANSPORTKÜHLSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">GESTION D'UN GÉNÉRATEUR ENTRAÎNÉ PAR ESSIEU DANS UN SYSTÈME DE RÉFRIGÉRATION DE TRANSPORT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MANAGEMENT OF AXLE DRIVEN GENERATOR IN A TRANSPORT REFRIGERATION SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A transport refrigeration system (20) includes a trailer (24) having an axle (204); a transport refrigeration unit (26) mounted to the trailer, transport refrigeration unit configured to cool a cargo compartment (40) of the trailer; an axle driven generator (206) connected to the axle, the axle driven generator configured to provide power to the transport refrigeration unit; a controller (230) in communication with the axle driven generator, the controller configured to disengage the axle driven generator from the axle in response to the presence of one or more disengagement conditions.</p>
            </abstract>
